  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "9C27AD88C6C617B9",
      "text": "Bienvenue à l’Arène d’Alforneira ! Faut-il que\\nje vous réexplique les modalités de l’examen ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "9C27AA88C6C612A0",
      "text": "Cet examen consiste à s’adonner à [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]des exercices[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]de fitness[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "9C27AB88C6C61453",
      "text": "C’est une invention de Tully. Elle appelle cela\\nle [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Fitness Émotion[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] !\\c\\nVous devez suivre le programme jusqu’au bout\\npour réussir l’épreuve !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "9C27B088C6C61CD2",
      "text": "Pour de plus amples informations, adressez-vous\\nà la fille en survêtement noir qui se trouve sur le\\r\\nterrain de fitness, à gauche en sortant de l’Arène.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "392AC325B77CF72F",
      "text": "Yo ! Ça va, l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A09)]e nouveaua nouvelle ?\\nBienvenue au Fitness Émotion ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "392AC425B77CF8E2",
      "text": "Tu te demandes sûrement ce qu’une prof\\nde combat fait dans un endroit pareil...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "392AC525B77CFA95",
      "text": "Eh bien, si je suis ici, c’est parce que Tully et moi,\\non se connaît depuis notre enfance.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_25",
      "hash64": "3931D325B783310D",
      "text": "Un jour, on s’est lancé un défi.\\c\\nOn a fait un combat Pokémon à l’issue duquel\\nla perdante devrait obéir à la gagnante.\\c\\nEt de fil en aiguille... voilà, quoi.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_26",
      "hash64": "3931D025B7832BF4",
      "text": "Enfin bref, quand je n’enseigne pas, je viens aider\\nTully. Et ça me permet de faire de l’exercice,\\r\\nce n’est pas si mal !\\c\\nMais assez parlé de moi.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "392ABE25B77CEEB0",
      "text": "Les règles du fitness sont simples : je te montre\\nles mouvements, et tu dois les reproduire ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "392ABF25B77CF063",
      "text": "Ton corps et ton esprit sont-ils prêts pour\\nl’examen d’Arène ?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "392AC025B77CF216",
      "text": "Bien, commençons les exercices !\\nLaisse-toi submerger par tes émotions ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "392AC125B77CF3C9",
      "text": "C’est important de bien se préparer, après tout !\\nReviens me voir quand tu voudras commencer.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "392ACA25B77D0314",
      "text": "Tu t’en sors très bien, l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A09)]e nouveaua nouvelle !\\nVous êtes impressionnants, ton Pokémon et toi ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A09"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_27",
      "hash64": "3931D125B7832DA7",
      "text": "C’était absolument incroyable !\\nTon talent m’a mise de bien bonne humeur ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "392ACB25B77D04C7",
      "text": "Maintenant que tu es bien échauffé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, faisons\\ntravailler tes muscles avec un combat Pokémon ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_battle_a_01",
      "hash64": "7BAAA2FB34884DBA",
      "text": "N’oublie pas : il faut bouger ! Ce n’est pas qu’un\\ncombat... on est aussi là pour faire du sport !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_esper_020_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "392E4825B7800F05",
      "text": "T[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0202)]ones Pokémon et tes muscles ont l’air d’apprécier\\nl’exercice ![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
